Package: svoya-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12)
Recommends: pciutils, snapper, flatpak
Conflicts: sosreport
Replaces: sosreport
Provides: svoya-theme
Description: sos, the SOS system tool
 "sos" (alias "svoya") manages SOS: GPU doctor, modules, the model store,
 themes, updates and undo. This package also carries the module catalog
 (/usr/share/svoya/modules), the theme tokens (/usr/share/svoya/themes) and
 the theme templates (/usr/share/svoya/templates).
 .
 It replaces Ubuntu's sosreport, which ships a different /usr/bin/sos.
